{"items":[{"id":"1266835782997925888","title":"算了，还是多说几句吧","content":"<p>算了，还是多说几句吧。&lt;br&gt;明天的中芯上市结局大概有三条路。&lt;br&gt;一条是中石油的、一条是中车的、另一条是自己的。&lt;br&gt;中石油的路大家都清楚，开盘暴涨然后没几天直接跌下去。&lt;br&gt;中车的路大家也都明白，开盘涨个几个月然后再想办法跌下去。&lt;br&gt;自己的路就很魔幻，拿着百倍的市盈率融资完直接破发，开启新型割韭菜模式。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;很多人问我从大局着想那种最好？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;那肯定是走中车的路，毕竟后面还有那么企业等着上市融资，有中芯打个样，最起码估价也能上去。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;（ps：大家是喜欢看我一本正经的分析还是发段子）</p>","excerpt":"算了，还是多说几句吧","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":10,"created":1594817187,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1266835782997925888"},{"id":"1266745498842312704","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-07de64ede8e13bc62c3abd2a516cfc50_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1133\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":15,"created":1594795661,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1266745498842312704"},{"id":"1266086678696579072","title":"如何让大A涨到5000点？ 举办小学生炒股大…","content":"<p>如何让大A涨到5000点？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;举办小学生炒股大赛，一二三等奖获得保送小升初机会。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;.......5000会不会保守了......</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-ebcdcfbad3c0b0820061a1144d4d6015_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"749\" height=\"1063\">","excerpt":"如何让大A涨到5000点？ 举办小学生炒股大…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":6,"created":1594638586,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1266086678696579072"},{"id":"1266036388384436224","title":"感觉未来可以搞一个小学生炒股大赛，让各…","content":"<p>感觉未来可以搞一个小学生炒股大赛，让各位家长秀秀肌肉。</p>","excerpt":"感觉未来可以搞一个小学生炒股大赛，让各…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":11,"created":1594626596,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1266036388384436224"},{"id":"1265672697071398912","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-c44a98c4f7119b739ba549ebcddab5e7_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"298\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":9,"created":1594539886,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1265672697071398912"},{"id":"1264901671639101440","title":"你以为的主力：慢牛慢牛，我们共同价投，…","content":"<p>你以为的主力：慢牛慢牛，我们共同价投，共同发展。&lt;br&gt;实际上的主力：走慢点，让我有时间先跑。</p>","excerpt":"你以为的主力：慢牛慢牛，我们共同价投，…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":7,"created":1594356059,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1264901671639101440"},{"id":"1264693577986347008","title":"何愁我股市不兴？","content":"<p>何愁我股市不兴？</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-706f6053567f34c21de71f01ca134cf7_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\">","excerpt":"何愁我股市不兴？","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":9,"created":1594306445,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1264693577986347008"},{"id":"1264299996977352704","title":"这几天我准备好好写写现在的股市的实质，…","content":"<p>这几天我准备好好写写现在的股市的实质，然后大家可以推给自己的父母。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;韭菜和产业资本博弈</p>","excerpt":"这几天我准备好好写写现在的股市的实质，…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":17,"created":1594212608,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1264299996977352704"},{"id":"1264181982038331392","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-8d72d3e50169682bd04771a1f388854f_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"526\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":6,"created":1594184471,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1264181982038331392"},{"id":"1263545381944152064","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-cdd860f5007b4dd21373df92e682de82_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"852\" height=\"352\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":3,"created":1594032694,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1263545381944152064"}]}